          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ngo 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïlenyona lentöy Echotyon TORORÖT, “Tökïne anka ato kyotorchan Yerusalem tïkwïn angwan cho ngwonöch cho komungan kor, chok nko kömöy nko tïpö wudïn nko amal nyo wongöy pich nko kyakikwa tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato ngotï chi nko monechi akïpkonchinyi, iros wölo lata ortïnekwa nko otöptinekwa. Ichömunenyi nyu lö, ki pö man omungön Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
